---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Automotive Tools" description="Future-ready section for calculators, service interval tools, and ownership utilities.">
  <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="surface p-8 sm:p-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tools</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">Automotive tools coming next</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-steel">
        This section is reserved for interactive features such as maintenance cost calculators, brake life estimators, and fluid capacity tools.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Planned utility pages</h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
          <li>Brake replacement cost calculator</li>
          <li>Oil service interval guide by vehicle</li>
          <li>Tire size and compatibility helper</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Implementation note</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-steel">
          This section is set aside for future tools that can make maintenance costs, intervals, and repair decisions easier to estimate.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
